},{"type":"h","text":"Researcher / Senior Research Associate"},{"type":"p","text":"Own:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research projects"},{"text":"Methodology"},{"text":"Analysis"},{"text":"Junior researchers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"8–12 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Researcher / Research Lead"},{"type":"p","text":"Own:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Major research projects"},{"text":"Research strategy"},{"text":"Funding/proposals"},{"text":"Publication programmes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"12+ Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Director / Academic / Research Program Head"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible paths:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Think tanks"},{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"Research institutions"},{"text":"Policy organisations"},{"text":"Corporate research"},{"text":"Technology ethics"},{"text":"International development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 Career Evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"Research itself will increasingly become AI-assisted, but critical human judgement will become more important."},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional research"},{"type":"flow","items":["Search","Read","Analyse","Write"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging research"},{"type":"flow","items":["AI-Assisted Discovery","Source Verification","Data Analysis","Human Interpretation","Evidence Synthesis","Research Output"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Research Analyst"},{"text":"AI Ethics Researcher"},{"text":"Responsible AI Researcher"},{"text":"Research Data Analyst"},{"text":"Computational Humanities Researcher"},{"text":"Digital Humanities Researcher"},{"text":"AI Governance Researcher"},{"text":"Technology Policy Researcher"},{"text":"Research Intelligence Specialist"},{"text":"Human-AI Interaction Researcher"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI applications"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist researchers with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Literature discovery"},{"text":"Document classification"},{"text":"Text summarisation"},{"text":"Qualitative coding"},{"text":"Dataset exploration"},{"text":"Pattern detection"},{"text":"Statistical assistance"},{"text":"Literature mapping"},{"text":"Research synthesis"},{"text":"Knowledge graphs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But researchers must retain responsibility for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Source verification"},{"text":"Research design"},{"text":"Methodological validity"},{"text":"Interpretation"},{"text":"Ethical decisions"},{"text":"Citation accuracy"},{"text":"Original contribution"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Philosophy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Logic"},{"text":"Ethics"},{"text":"Epistemology"},{"text":"Political philosophy"},{"text":"Philosophy of science"},{"text":"Philosophy of technology"},{"text":"Indian philosophy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Literature review"},{"text":"Research design"},{"text":"Qualitative methods"},{"text":"Quantitative methods"},{"text":"Critical analysis"},{"text":"Academic writing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"R/Python"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Survey tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Zotero/Mendeley"},{"text":"Academic databases"},{"text":"Qualitative analysis tools"},{"text":"Digital research platforms"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI fundamentals"},{"text":"AI-assisted research"},{"text":"AI ethics"},{"text":"AI governance"},{"text":"Source verification"},{"text":"Responsible AI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research communication"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Policy writing"},{"text":"Report writing"},{"text":"Collaboration"},{"text":"Project management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Philosophy","Research Methods + Domain Specialisation","Research Internship","Research Portfolio","MA/Relevant PG","Research Assistant / Research Analyst","Research Associate","Researcher / Specialist Researcher","Senior Researcher / Research Lead","Research Director / Academic / Independent Research Consultant"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best overall strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"For a Philosophy graduate targeting Researcher, the strongest route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Philosophy","rigorous research methodology","one domain specialisation","data skills","research internship","strong research portfolio","postgraduate study."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The most future-ready combinations are Philosophy + AI Ethics, Philosophy + Public Policy, Philosophy + Bioethics, Philosophy + Technology Governance, and Philosophy + Digital Humanities. These allow the graduate to turn philosophy's core strengths—logic, critical reasoning, conceptual analysis and ethical judgement—into specialised research capabilities that remain valuable as AI increasingly automates basic information-search and summarisation tasks."}]}]}